@startuml
title А3. Компоненты Authorization и Card Management
scale max 1600*900
left to right direction
package "Authorization Service" {
  component "AuthControllerImpl\nREST authorize / rollback" as ac
  component "AuthServiceImpl\nбизнес-правила, @Transactional" as asvc
  component "CardManagementClientImpl\nREST client" as cmsclient
  component "BinLookupClient\nREST; connect 3s/read 5s" as binclient
  component "LimitUsageRepository\nJPA/JDBC" as limits
  component "AuthorizationEventNotifierImpl" as events
}
package "Card Management Service" {
  component "CardController" as cc
  component "CardServiceImpl" as csvc
  component "CardRepositoryPersistenceAdapter" as cardrepo
  component "ReservationRepositoryPersistenceAdapter" as reservrepo
  component "ReservationRollbackRepositoryPersistenceAdapter" as rollbackrepo
  component "OutboxRepository / OutboxJpaAdapter" as outrepo
  component "OutboxEventProcessorImpl" as processor
}
cloud "BIN Lookup" as bin
queue "RabbitTemplate → smp.card-events" as mq
database "PostgreSQL" as db
ac --> asvc : sync method call
asvc --> cmsclient : getCard / reserve / rollback
asvc --> binclient : issuerId(PAN[0..6])
asvc --> limits : upsert limits; fetch RRN block
asvc --> events : notify outcome
cmsclient --> cc : HTTP sync
binclient --> bin : HTTP sync; failures return empty
cc --> csvc : sync method call
csvc --> cardrepo : read/update card
csvc --> reservrepo : reservation lifecycle
csvc --> rollbackrepo : compensating credit
csvc --> outrepo : persist outbox event
cardrepo --> db : JDBC/JPA
reservrepo --> db : JDBC/JPA
rollbackrepo --> db : JDBC/JPA
outrepo --> db : JDBC/JPA
limits --> db : JDBC/JPA
processor --> outrepo : load PENDING/update status
processor --> mq : AMQP async publish card.<EventClass>
note bottom of asvc
Authorize: load card → require ACTIVE → validate expiry/funds →
upsert daily/monthly limits → reserve → APPROVED. Failures map to
DeclineOutcome. Source: services/authorization/.../AuthServiceImpl.java,
DeclineOutcome.java, client/CardManagementClientImpl.java.
end note
note bottom of csvc
Reserve subtracts availableBalance and stores Reservation.
Rollback restores amount and changes Reservation to ROLLED_BACK.
Outbox publication is a separate processor. Source: CardServiceImpl.java,
models/Card.java, models/Reservation.java, OutboxEventProcessorImpl.java.
end note
@enduml
